{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e09-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "清淡的工作盒饭  (Sharing a Bland Box Lunch)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "During the studio lunch break, Xin Huimei surprises Chun Yuqiao backstage and phones her agent to back up her excuse for visiting. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你怎么突然过来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我来熟悉一下演出场地，方便后面的演出。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这怎么可能呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你不信啊？那我打个电话问问。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美姐，怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "是不是你让我来熟悉一下演播厅场地的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "是啊，没错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你吃午饭了吗？附近有个西餐厅，我让人给你送过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不用了，我吃和你一样的就行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我这个是单做的，没什么味儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这么清淡啊，简直和我之前吃的减肥餐一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我刚出道的时候，还是个大胖子呢。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你怎么突然过来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Why did you suddenly come over here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我来熟悉一下演出场地，方便后面的演出。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I came to get familiar with the performance venue to make later shows easier.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这怎么可能呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How could that possibly be true?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你不信啊？那我打个电话问问。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You do not believe me? Let me make a quick call and ask.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "惠美姐，怎么了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Huimei, what is the matter?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "是不是你让我来熟悉一下演播厅场地的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Were you not the one who told me to come familiarise myself with the studio venue?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "是啊，没错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes, that is right.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你吃午饭了吗？附近有个西餐厅，我让人给你送过来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you had lunch yet? There is a Western restaurant nearby; I can have them deliver something for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "不用了，我吃和你一样的就行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need; eating the same meal as yours is fine by me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我这个是单做的，没什么味儿。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mine was specially made without seasoning, so it has hardly any flavour.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这么清淡啊，简直和我之前吃的减肥餐一样。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is so light, practically identical to the diet meals I used to eat.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我刚出道的时候，还是个大胖子呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When I first debuted, I used to be quite chubby.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你怎么突然过来了？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我来熟悉一下演出场地，方便后面的演出。",
      "gap": 0.5
