    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我这个是单做的，没什么味儿。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这么清淡啊，简直和我之前吃的减肥餐一样。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我刚出道的时候，还是个大胖子呢。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Xin Huimei happily shares Chun Yuqiao's plain recovery meal and jokes about how she used to diet when she first debuted. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
